{"2226150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Table Party", "steam_appid": 2226150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4266980, 2242492, 2242490, 2227721, 2227720, 4714280], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the ultimate VR party game experience with <strong>Table Party!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard; it’s time for <strong>Table Party!</strong> ✨<br><br>Enjoy a lively VR board game night with friends <strong>anytime, anywhere.</strong> Dive into a growing collection of tabletop and casual games, set in <strong>beautifully detailed, interactive environments. </strong>Bring your friends and family together for laughter and fun, or play solo with our challenging AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/a4567b4762df6e21e3bae27d75e9eede.poster.avif?t=1786624054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/a4567b4762df6e21e3bae27d75e9eede.webm?t=1786624054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/a4567b4762df6e21e3bae27d75e9eede.mp4?t=1786624054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>17 Base Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in the mood for strategy, card games, or party challenges, there's something for everyone.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy:</strong> Chess, Checkers, Othello, Omok, Janggi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards &amp; Tabletop:</strong> Yacht Dice, Rummy, Gin Rummy, One Card, Matgo, Yut Nori</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Games:</strong> Blocktris, Stack Up, Flying Arrow, Whack a Mole, Catch the Ghost</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/e0b6057875ebb51e252c74df1ae05624.poster.avif?t=1786624054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/e0b6057875ebb51e252c74df1ae05624.webm?t=1786624054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226150/extras/e0b6057875ebb51e252c74df1ae05624.mp4?t=1786624054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Board &amp; Party Games</strong> – From timeless classics to fast-paced party favorites, there's always something new to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong> – Challenge AI opponents solo or invite up to 4 players for online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Into a Game</strong> – Create a private party with friends or use Quick Match to find players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Leaderboards</strong> – Set high scores, beat the competition, and see how you stack up against players around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hang Out in VR</strong> – Play in a selection of unique environments that make every game night feel a little different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet in the Community Room</strong> – Gather with up to 8 players, chat, and organize your next match before taking a seat at the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Board Games</strong> – Take a break with interactive activities like Darts and Beer Pong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct